 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Apocalypse Descends, I Reincarnated As A Tyrant"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "末世降临,我重生成暴君"
   },
   {
    "en": "Apocalypse Reset: Rise of the Tyrant"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Luo Hao was betrayed by espers in a monster-infested apocalypse. Just as he was filled with regret, he found himself returned to the time before the end of the world—and awakened an Evolution System with limitless potential! This time, Luo Hao swore to take revenge on those who betrayed him, and to build an indestructible fortress amidst the apocalypse. However, espers began awakening ahead of time, and it seemed someone was manipulating events from the shadows. Everything was spiraling out of control. Strangest of all was Luo Hao’s Evolution System—it seemed to be pushing him down an irreversible path…"
  },
